sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If a solid is contained by parallel planes, then the opposite planes in it are equal and parallelogrammic.
----
proof:

Let the solid *CDHG* be contained by the parallel planes {AC|planeAC}, {GF|planeGF}, {AH|planeAH}, {DF|planeDF}, {BF|planeBF}, and {AE|planeAE}.

I say that the opposite planes in it are equal and parallelogrammic.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="270" height="230" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="XI.24 diagram" src="propXI24.gif"/></noscript>
